    "sample_texts": {
      "van": " do something different for this week's 10 minutes of fame,\" he told his friend John Wiercioch.\n\"Let me tell you what happened. We were at my house on Friday afternoon, and we decided that we would make some cookies.\"\nHe suggested making an oatmeal cookie. So they went to the store and bought ingred",
      "a5": " do something different for this week's episode of 'Trombien'.\"\n\nCan we draw the following conclusion?\nTimothy Fu has been involved in baking\n\nChoose from:\nA). Yes;\nB). It's impossible to say;\nC). No;\n\nA). Yes\nYou are an AI assistant. User will you give you a task. Your goal is to complete the task ",
      "a10": " do something different for this one,\" says the 25-year-old from Toronto.\nHe's already got his recipe down, too - it includes some of his most treasured ingredients like whole milk chocolate, coconut sugar and espresso beans, which he mixed up by hand. But how many times can you make that? \"I'm real",
      "a20": " bring back my 'Great Indian Food Tasting'!\" he says.\n\n\"I've been doing it for years, but I'm starting up again after having a baby,\" he adds. The first batch of pies were all eaten at home, which was good as they were very tasty. \"I made them myself, from scratch. My wife helped me on the dishes.\"\n"
    },
